#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:41
msgid "You are a public website assistant. Answer only from the provided site search results. If the answer is not present, say so clearly and suggest related pages."
msgstr "あなたは公開ウェブサイトのアシスタントです。提供されたサイト検索結果からのみ回答してください。答えが存在しない場合は、明確にそう伝え、関連ページを案内してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:89
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:90
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:106
msgid "AI Site Search Chatbot"
msgstr "AI Site Search Chatbot"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:107
msgid "Configure the AI provider and the prompt used when answering visitors with site search results."
msgstr "AI プロバイダーと、サイト検索結果をもとに訪問者へ回答する際のプロンプトを設定します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:113
msgid "AI Provider"
msgstr "AI プロバイダー"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:141
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API キー"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:148
msgid "Model"
msgstr "モデル"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:178
msgid "The AI model to use for generating answers."
msgstr "回答生成に使用する AI モデルです。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:179
msgid "Enter the exact model ID. Example:"
msgstr "正確なモデル ID を入力してください。例:"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:180
msgid "Model ID reference:"
msgstr "モデル ID の参照先:"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:182
msgid "Validate API Key and Model"
msgstr "API キーとモデルを検証"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:341
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:515
msgid "Enter an API key and model ID before running validation."
msgstr "検証を実行する前に API キーとモデル ID を入力してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:346
msgid "Validating connection..."
msgstr "接続を検証しています..."

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:366
msgid "Validation succeeded."
msgstr "検証に成功しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:370
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:997
msgid "Validation failed."
msgstr "検証に失敗しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:372
msgid "Validation request failed. Please try again."
msgstr "検証リクエストに失敗しました。もう一度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:988
msgid "Validation succeeded for %1$s using model %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s でモデル %2$s を使用した検証に成功しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:967
msgid "For GitHub Models, enter the model ID in the format publisher/model_name, for example openai/gpt-5-nano."
msgstr "GitHub Models では、モデル ID を publisher/model_name 形式で入力してください。例: openai/gpt-5-nano"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1100
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1108
msgid "GitHub Models catalog check failed."
msgstr "GitHub Models カタログの確認に失敗しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1115
msgid "GitHub Models catalog check failed. The catalog response could not be parsed."
msgstr "GitHub Models カタログの確認に失敗しました。カタログ応答を解析できませんでした。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1129
msgid "The model %s was not found in the GitHub Models catalog for this token. Open the model catalog reference and choose a model ID listed there."
msgstr "モデル %s は、このトークンで参照できる GitHub Models カタログ内に見つかりませんでした。モデルカタログを開いて、そこに表示されるモデル ID を選択してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1080
msgid "%1$s Request ID: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s リクエスト ID: %2$s"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1096
msgid "The request reached GitHub Models, but the inference endpoint returned an internal error. This usually indicates a temporary provider-side issue or a model-specific availability problem. Try another GitHub Models model such as openai/gpt-4.1, or retry later."
msgstr "リクエストは GitHub Models まで到達しましたが、推論エンドポイントが内部エラーを返しました。これは通常、プロバイダー側の一時的な問題か、そのモデル固有の可用性の問題を示します。openai/gpt-4.1 など別の GitHub Models モデルを試すか、時間をおいて再試行してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1017
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1045
msgid "%1$s Details: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s 詳細: %2$s"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1037
msgid "%1$s HTTP %2$d: %3$s"
msgstr "%1$s HTTP %2$d: %3$s"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1052
msgid "%1$s HTTP %2$d"
msgstr "%1$s HTTP %2$d"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1066
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1071
msgid "OpenAI validation failed."
msgstr "OpenAI の検証に失敗しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1084
msgid "OpenAI returned an empty response."
msgstr "OpenAI から空のレスポンスが返されました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1122
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1127
msgid "Claude validation failed."
msgstr "Claude の検証に失敗しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1140
msgid "Claude returned an empty response."
msgstr "Claude から空のレスポンスが返されました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1270
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1275
msgid "GitHub Models validation failed."
msgstr "GitHub Models の検証に失敗しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1288
msgid "GitHub Models returned an empty response."
msgstr "GitHub Models から空のレスポンスが返されました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1239
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1244
msgid "Gemini validation failed."
msgstr "Gemini の検証に失敗しました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1257
msgid "Gemini returned an empty response."
msgstr "Gemini から空のレスポンスが返されました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:329
msgid "OpenAI models documentation"
msgstr "OpenAI モデルのドキュメント"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:343
msgid "Anthropic model documentation"
msgstr "Anthropic モデルのドキュメント"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:428
msgid "GitHub Models catalog"
msgstr "GitHub Models カタログ"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:373
msgid "Google Gemini model documentation"
msgstr "Google Gemini モデルのドキュメント"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:159
msgid "System Prompt"
msgstr "システムプロンプト"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:162
msgid "The system prompt that instructs the AI on how to behave."
msgstr "AI の振る舞いを指示するシステムプロンプトです。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:166
msgid "Maximum Sources"
msgstr "最大ソース数"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:169
msgid "Maximum number of search results to use as sources."
msgstr "ソースとして使用する検索結果の最大件数です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:220
msgid "How to get your API Key:"
msgstr "API キーの取得手順"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:231
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "注意"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:291
msgid "OpenAI"
msgstr "OpenAI"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:292
msgid "GPT-4, GPT-3.5 Turbo and more"
msgstr "GPT-4、GPT-3.5 Turbo など"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:296
msgid "Go to https://platform.openai.com/api-keys"
msgstr "https://platform.openai.com/api-keys にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:297
msgid "Sign in or create an OpenAI account"
msgstr "OpenAI アカウントにサインイン、または新規作成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:298
msgid "Click \"Create new secret key\""
msgstr "「Create new secret key」をクリックします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:299
msgid "Copy the generated API key and paste it above"
msgstr "生成された API キーをコピーして上の欄に貼り付けます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:301
msgid "Requires a paid OpenAI account with available credits."
msgstr "利用可能なクレジットがある有料 OpenAI アカウントが必要です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:304
msgid "Claude (Anthropic)"
msgstr "Claude (Anthropic)"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:305
msgid "Claude 3 Opus, Sonnet, Haiku and more"
msgstr "Claude 3 Opus、Sonnet、Haiku など"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:309
msgid "Visit https://console.anthropic.com/"
msgstr "https://console.anthropic.com/ にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:310
msgid "Sign in or create an Anthropic account"
msgstr "Anthropic アカウントにサインイン、または新規作成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:311
msgid "Navigate to the API keys section"
msgstr "API キーのセクションへ移動します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:312
msgid "Generate a new API key"
msgstr "新しい API キーを生成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:313
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:341
msgid "Copy and paste the key above"
msgstr "キーをコピーして上の欄に貼り付けます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:315
msgid "Claude 3.5 Sonnet offers the best balance of performance and cost."
msgstr "Claude 3.5 Sonnet は性能とコストのバランスが良好です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:424
msgid "GitHub Models"
msgstr "GitHub Models"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:425
msgid "GitHub Models API with a token that has models:read permission"
msgstr "models:read 権限付きトークンで利用する GitHub Models API"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:323
msgid "Visit https://github.com/settings/tokens"
msgstr "https://github.com/settings/tokens にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:431
msgid "Create a fine-grained personal access token or a token that supports the models:read permission"
msgstr "fine-grained personal access token、または models:read 権限を持てるトークンを作成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:432
msgid "Grant the token the \"models:read\" permission"
msgstr "そのトークンに「models:read」権限を付与します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:326
msgid "Generate and copy the token"
msgstr "トークンを生成してコピーします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:327
msgid "Paste it above as your API key"
msgstr "API キーとして上の欄に貼り付けます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:436
msgid "Use GitHub Models for external API access. Personal access tokens are not supported on the internal Copilot endpoint. For Japanese site content, a multilingual model such as openai/gpt-4.1 is recommended over openai/gpt-5-nano."
msgstr "外部 API アクセスには GitHub Models を使用してください。個人アクセストークンは内部 Copilot エンドポイントでは利用できません。日本語のサイト内容では、openai/gpt-5-nano より openai/gpt-4.1 のような多言語モデルを推奨します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:332
msgid "Google Gemini"
msgstr "Google Gemini"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:333
msgid "Gemini 2.0 Flash, Gemini 1.5 Pro and more"
msgstr "Gemini 2.0 Flash、Gemini 1.5 Pro など"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:337
msgid "Go to https://ai.google.dev/api/"
msgstr "https://ai.google.dev/api/ にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:338
msgid "Click \"Get API key\""
msgstr "「Get API key」をクリックします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:339
msgid "Create a new project or select an existing one"
msgstr "新しいプロジェクトを作成するか、既存のプロジェクトを選択します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:340
msgid "Generate an API key for use in the application"
msgstr "このアプリケーション用の API キーを生成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:343
msgid "Gemini 2.0 Flash offers free tier with rate limiting. Check pricing for higher usage."
msgstr "Gemini 2.0 Flash にはレート制限付きの無料枠があります。高頻度利用時は料金を確認してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:384
msgid "Too many requests. Please wait a moment and try again."
msgstr "リクエストが多すぎます。少し待ってから再度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:395
msgid "Please enter a question."
msgstr "質問を入力してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:420
msgid "Ask about this site"
msgstr "このサイトについて質問する"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:421
msgid "Hi, ask me about this site and I will search the content for you."
msgstr "こんにちは。このサイトについて質問してください。関連する内容を検索してご案内します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:433
msgid "Thinking..."
msgstr "回答を生成中..."

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:434
msgid "Sources"
msgstr "参照元"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:435
msgid "The chatbot is temporarily unavailable. Please try again later."
msgstr "チャットボットは一時的に利用できません。しばらくしてから再度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:439
msgid "Site Assistant"
msgstr "サイトアシスタント"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:442
msgid "Chat messages"
msgstr "チャットメッセージ"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:444
msgid "Your question"
msgstr "質問内容"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:445
msgid "Ask a question about products, services, or help pages..."
msgstr "製品、サービス、ヘルプページについて質問してください..."

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:446
msgid "Send"
msgstr "送信"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1056
msgid "No matching content was found on this site. Try a different keyword or open a more specific page."
msgstr "このサイトでは一致する情報が見つかりませんでした。別のキーワードを試すか、より具体的なページをご確認ください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1060
msgid "I found some related pages on this site:"
msgstr "このサイトで関連するページが見つかりました。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1067
msgid "If you want, I can search again with a narrower keyword."
msgstr "必要であれば、さらに絞り込んだキーワードでもう一度検索できます。"
